<%- include('header') %>
<section class="section claim-layout"><div class="claim-intro"><a class="back-link" href="/links">← Back to our links</a><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE TREAT FROM RAJU REYAZ</span><h1>Your next visit.<br> <em>A golden little perk.</em></h1><p>Tell us a little about your visit. Then spin to reveal a discount that’s yours to keep.</p><div class="prize-preview"><span class="preview-label"><%- include('icon',{name:'gift'}) %> YOUR WELCOME REWARD</span><div><span>₹100</span><i>—</i><span>₹150</span></div><p>off an eligible salon service</p><span class="ticket-rule"></span><small>One claim. One surprise. All yours.</small></div><div class="claim-steps"><span><b>1</b> Fill in your details</span><span><b>2</b> Reveal your reward</span><span><b>3</b> Download & visit</span></div><p class="real-stats"><span class="dot"></span><strong><%= stats.recent %> <%= stats.recent===1?'person has':'people have' %></strong> applied in the last 24 hours.<small><%= stats.total %> of 100 welcome coupons claimed</small></p></div>
<div class="form-card compact-form"><div class="form-heading"><span class="form-icon"><%- include('icon',{name:'sparkle'}) %></span><div><h2>Claim your offer</h2><p>Your good-look moment starts here.</p></div></div>
<% if(error){ %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<% if(stats.total>=100||!offers.length){ %><div class="closed-offer"><h3>That’s all for this offer.</h3><p>Call <a href="tel:+919126691868">9126691868</a> to discover our current promotions.</p></div><% }else{ %>
<form method="post" action="/claim" id="lead-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="form-grid">
<label>Full Name <span>*</span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Your full name" value="<%= values.name||'' %>"></label>
<label>Mobile Number <span>*</span><div class="mobile-input"><span>+91</span><input type="tel" name="mobile" autocomplete="tel-national" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[6-9][0-9]{9}" maxlength="10" required placeholder="10-digit number" value="<%= values.mobile||'' %>"></div></label>
<label>Choose a Service <span>*</span><select name="service" required><option value="">Select service</option><% services.forEach(s=>{ %><option <%= values.service===s.name?'selected':'' %>><%= s.name %></option><% }); %></select></label>
<label>Preferred Visit Date <span>*</span><input type="date" name="preferred_visit_date" min="<%= today %>" max="<%= maxVisitDate %>" required value="<%= values.preferred_visit_date||'' %>"></label>
</div><% if(offers.length===1){ %><input type="hidden" name="offer" value="<%= offers[0].id %>"><% }else{ %><label>Select your offer<select name="offer" required><% offers.forEach(o=>{ %><option value="<%= o.id %>" <%= o.id===selected?'selected':'' %>><%= o.title %></option><% }); %></select></label><% } %>
<label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required <%= values.consent==='yes'?'checked':'' %>><span>I agree to the <a href="/privacy">terms & privacy policy</a> and consent to a WhatsApp coupon confirmation and contact about my visit from Raju Reyaz.</span></label>
<button class="button wide" type="submit">Claim Offer <%- include('icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></button><p class="form-note"><%- include('icon',{name:'check'}) %> One coupon per mobile · Valid for <%= settings.validity %> days</p></form><details class="form-terms"><summary>How does the offer work?</summary><p>Your discount is randomly selected between ₹100 and ₹150, inclusive, once your details are accepted. Download your coupon and present it at the salon. No cash value; discount cannot exceed your bill or be combined with other offers. A preferred date is not a confirmed appointment.</p></details><% } %>
</div></section><%- include('footer') %>
